Since it seems to me that it is impossible to perfectly check for
traps at an early level, I instead leave them until the poison
intrinsic, a unicorn horn and enough health to survive any trap
effect. Always put away all rings and wands, in the event it may be
electric and your burnables, as it could be fire.

This leaves paralysis as the biggest threat, take realistic
precautions, such as locking doors and a semi-permanent E-square.

In shops... don't, unless you can afford to easily. Probably best to
wait for level 21 here.

I know it is excessive, and you probably knew most of the data
already, but it seems the only truly safe way.


